  "description": "Phases.Umbraco.MiniRollback is an Umbraco 13+ package that adds version history access directly to your content editing interface. \nBy placing a small icon next to text fields, rich text editors, and textareas, editors can instantly view previous versions of specific content fields in a simple popup without leaving the page. \nMaking content comparison and recovery faster and easier than ever.",
